# Track docs/ (Arshad, 2026-08-28): everything except the local-only areas below
# (design mockups are approval artifacts; research corpus and review outputs are generated,
# machine-local records — their durable distillations are tracked in stack-notes/specs)
docs/design/mockups/
docs/research/
docs/reviews/
# Subagent run outputs (Arshad 2026-10-11): generated local records like reviews; load-bearing
